trong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--studio-text, #0f172a);"><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-panel-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.06)) 70%, transparent 30%); color: rgb(14, 165, 233); border: 1px solid var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.25));">dpsub24@gmail.com</code></strong> and your normal password.</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.72));"><span class="text-blue-400 mt-0.5">â€¢</span><span>On the next page load, the app detects the email is in <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-panel-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.06)) 70%, transparent 30%); color: rgb(14, 165, 233); border: 1px solid var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.25));">ADMIN_EMAILS</code> and promotes the account to the <strong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--studio-text, #0f172a);">ADMIN</strong> role (this happens automatically on every authenticated request â€” no manual step).</span></li><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.72));"><span class="text-blue-400 mt-0.5">â€¢</span><span>You'll see an <strong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--studio-text, #0f172a);">Admin</strong> link in the navigation (plus "Alrahuz" and "Payment gateway" entries).</span></li></ul><div class="h-2"></div><p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.72));">(If you're already logged in, just reload the page â€” the promotion triggers on the next request.)</p><div class="h-2"></div><h3 class="iqx-markdown-heading" data-level="2">Where to configure the APIs</h3><ul class="space-y-1 my-2 ml-4"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.72));"><span class="text-blue-400 mt-0.5">â€¢</span><span><strong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(-