(148,163,184,0.25));">src/app/api/wallet/fund/route.ts</code></strong> â€” now also returns the <code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-panel-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.06)) 70%, transparent 30%); color: rgb(14, 165, 233); border: 1px solid var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.25));">accessCode</code> from Paystack's server-side initialization.</span></li></ul><div class="h-2"></div><ul class="space-y-1 my-2 ml-4"><li class="text-sm flex items-start gap-2" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.72));"><span class="text-blue-400 mt-0.5">â€¢</span><span><strong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--studio-text, #0f172a);"><code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-mono" style="background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-panel-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.06)) 70%, transparent 30%); color: rgb(14, 165, 233); border: 1px solid var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.25));">src/components/wallet/fund-form.tsx</code></strong> â€” instead of redirecting, it now opens <strong class="font-semibold" style="color: var(--studio-text, #0f172a);">Paystack InlineJS v2</strong> in an in-page modal:</span></li></ul><div class="h-2"></div><div class="my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-lg border" style="border-color: var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.25)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-panel-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.08)) 82%, transparent 18%);"><div class="border-b px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em]" style="border-color: var(--studio-border, rgba(148,163,184,0.18)); color: var(--studio-text-muted, rgba(100,116,139,0.88)); background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--studio-surface, rgba(15,23,42,0.05)) 72%, transparent 28%);">ts</div><pre class="overflow-x-auto px-3 py-2.5 text-[12px] leading-5"><code class="font-mono" style="color: var(--studio-text-soft, rgba(15,23,42,0.78));">new PaystackPop().resumeTransaction(accessCode, { onSuccess, onCancel, onError })</code></pre><